+- HELP -- context: Sessions page -------------------------+
| navigation   up/k up | down/j down | pgup page up        |
|              pgdown page down | home top | end bottom    |
| page actions enter open | t review tx | / filter         |
|              r reload | esc back                         |
| error modal  enter ok / close | esc close                |
|              j/k scroll one line                         |
|              pgup/pgdown scroll ten lines                |
| global       1-8 pages | :/ctrl+p palette | c connect    |
|              tab/shift+tab focus pane                    |
|              f9 toggle mouse / text selection | ? this   |
|              q quit / back | ctrl+c graceful quit        |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
